{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Contents\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deluxe version of &quot;FART DROP,&quot; a free game created by our circle in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a puzzle game with a strong random element that focuses on &quot;farting&quot; and &quot;holding in a bowel movement&quot; situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three play modes: &quot;Working,&quot; &quot;City,&quot; and &quot;Holiday.&quot; In &quot;Working&quot; and &quot;City&quot; modes, a single image will be displayed when the game is over or cleared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game mode\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Live Broadcast&quot; mode: Try to hold in your farts while you make it through the live broadcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;City&quot; mode: Try to hold in your farts while you make it to the bathroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Home&quot; mode: There's no one around. Fart as much as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010How to operate\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main game, you can &quot;tighten&quot; by clicking, &quot;loosen&quot; by releasing the click, and &quot;mix&quot; by touching the gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check the controls and how to play in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Precautions\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAvailable in Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe game content in &quot;Working&quot; mode, and the single images that appear when the game is over or cleared, are the same as those in the free game &quot;FART DROP.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766510?t=1749930300","bac